# Git and ship

Do this without being asked. Work in `C:\Users\rober\Documents\GitHub\FamilyShieldPro` only.

## Branch

Do not commit product work straight to `main`. From latest `origin/main`:

- `feature/short-name` — new behavior
- `fix/short-name` — a bug
- `chore/short-name` — rules, docs, tooling

One concern per branch. Push with `git push -u origin HEAD`. Open a PR into `main` with `gh pr create`. Merge it, then delete the branch.

## Commit and push

Every finished slice: commit, then push. Do not leave work only on the machine.

Never commit `.env`, `*.db`, `media/build`, `installers/`, or secrets. No force-push to `main`. No `--no-verify`.

## Release (PHP/product changes only)

After the PR is on `main`: bump `Db::VERSION`, run `build_php_zip.ps1`, `gh release create`, return the zip URL. Unzip into `public_html`; keep the live `.env`.

Do not print live `.env` secrets. Never stamp a request as safe.
